{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52736","headline":"丹元子步天歌 西方七宿 四 · 王希明","name":"丹元子步天歌 西方七宿 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昴，七星一聚实不少。\n阿西月东各一星，月下五黄天阴名。\n阴下六乌刍藁营，营南十六天苑形。\n河里六星名卷舌，舌中黑点天谗星，砺石舌傍斜四丁。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王希明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52736.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52736","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}